Aesuklap main application:
GPL

ImagePool DICOM Bridge Library:
LGPL

DCMTK - OFFIS DICOM Toolkit:
BSD/MIT</property>
    <property name="authors">Alexander Pipelka &lt;pipelka@teleweb.at&gt;

Win32 and DICOMDIR support:
Gianluca Ghelli</property>
